# Recorder B for the L2-MRG-007 pairing cases: an exact copy of recorder A's
# whole pair (merge-continuation-a.hex). Under --collapse-duplicates both of
# B's records collapse, leaving one error and one continuation.

# RT15 SA11 Receive, ERRORED -- identical to recorder A's @ .000500
0248 0F18 20DB F401 7E79 0000 0000 1E01

# SPURIOUS_DATA continuation -> 0x2000, stamped @ .000510 -- identical to A's
2005 0F18 20DB FE01 0000
